UpdateSyncQualityCheckData.requestParamsDescription:
**Description of jsonStr properties:**  
| Property | Value Type | Required | Description |  
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |  
| sourceType | Int | Yes | Data Type: 1 indicates real-time voice, and 0 indicates real-time text. |  
| tid | String | Yes | UUID of the current conversation. This identifier is unique for each conversation, and the backend uses it to merge segments into a complete conversation. |  
| voiceFileUrl | String | Yes | URL of the recording file, used for playback during review. The URL must be HTTP-accessible. Submission of local files is not supported. The URL must use a domain name instead of an IP address, must not contain spaces, and should avoid Chinese characters as much as possible. The recording file must have public access permissions and remain accessible long-term; otherwise, playback will fail when viewing file details or performing file review. |  
| fileName | String | Yes | Name of the recording file. |  

